WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.459 --> 00:00:05.009
I used to smile a lot; I was strong.

00:00:05.009 --> 00:00:08.679
Here, on this picture, I was 16 or 17.

00:00:08.679 --> 00:00:14.260
That’s me with a friend here - we were so
happy back then.

00:00:14.260 --> 00:00:17.569
Handan Aşkin enjoys looking at her old pictures.

00:00:17.569 --> 00:00:20.169
She likes to remember her teenage years.

00:00:20.169 --> 00:00:24.689
But there’s one person she’s torn out
of all the photos: Her husband.

00:00:24.689 --> 00:00:28.109
The man who nearly killed her.

00:00:28.109 --> 00:00:35.140
Throughout the 10 year of our relationship,
he hit me, he beat me, he insulted me.

00:00:35.140 --> 00:00:40.510
(short pause) It happened in the bedroom,
too…

00:00:40.510 --> 00:00:48.309
One day – and I will never forget it – I
went to work with a black eye and split lips.

00:00:48.309 --> 00:00:57.559
I didn’t want to get fired – HE wasn’t
working.

00:00:57.559 --> 00:01:00.089
But then, Handan couldn’t take it anymore.

00:01:00.089 --> 00:01:01.379
She wanted to leave her husband.

00:01:01.379 --> 00:01:04.640
There is video footage of what happened next.

00:01:04.640 --> 00:01:06.740
One day, he approached her with a gun.

00:01:06.740 --> 00:01:08.340
And shot her.

00:01:08.340 --> 00:01:11.670
I thought: This is it.

00:01:11.670 --> 00:01:13.340
I am going to die.

00:01:13.340 --> 00:01:17.610
I was on the ground, injured - he put the
gun in my mouth and pulled the trigger – but

00:01:17.610 --> 00:01:19.840
he had run out of bullets.

00:01:19.840 --> 00:01:21.370
That was my second chance.

00:01:21.370 --> 00:01:22.820
(Thank God.)

00:01:22.820 --> 00:01:29.270
For two-and-a-half years, I have been re-living
that moment over and over again.

00:01:29.270 --> 00:01:33.700
I try not to let anyone notice - neither my
children, nor the people around m).

00:01:33.700 --> 00:01:37.469
But over and over, in my dreams, I see this
man trying to kill me.

00:01:37.469 --> 00:01:40.220
Since then, Handan has been paralyzed from

00:01:40.220 --> 00:01:41.530
the waist down.

00:01:41.530 --> 00:01:43.539
Her husband is in detention.

00:01:43.539 --> 00:01:45.869
On paper, they’re still married.

00:01:45.869 --> 00:01:52.060
His trial for attempted murder has been dragging on for over two years…

00:01:52.060 --> 00:01:55.040
Today, there is another hearing.

00:01:55.040 --> 00:01:57.689
Her brother, Sedat, accompanies Handan to court.

00:01:57.689 --> 00:02:03.170
She’s actually is entitled to a driver,
paid by the municipality.

00:02:03.170 --> 00:02:07.460
But that often doesn't work out.

00:02:07.460 --> 00:02:19.010
Instead, she takes a taxi.

00:02:19.010 --> 00:02:21.250
Handan hates these court dates.

00:02:21.250 --> 00:02:30.670
The prospect of having to see her husband again scares her.

00:02:30.670 --> 00:02:33.650
I want him to receive the toughest punishment
possible.

00:02:33.650 --> 00:02:47.840
Five or ten years are just not enough for
what he put me through.

00:02:47.840 --> 00:02:51.560
Reliable data on violence against women in
Turkey is scarce.

00:02:51.560 --> 00:02:55.350
But what little DOES exist suggests the numbers
are rising…

00:02:55.350 --> 00:03:02.310
The women we talk to in Istanbul confirm this:
We’ve all experienced abuse – be it physical,

00:03:02.310 --> 00:03:03.310
or psychological.

00:03:03.310 --> 00:03:10.170
Of course, there is violence against women
here, and reports on women being murdered

00:03:10.170 --> 00:03:14.010
are increasing – we’re sick of it!

00:03:14.010 --> 00:03:16.280
My neighbor beats his wife.

00:03:16.280 --> 00:03:18.480
I think it’s out of jealousy.

00:03:18.480 --> 00:03:20.990
But many men beg to differ.)

00:03:20.990 --> 00:03:22.670
I haven’t noticed anything.

00:03:22.670 --> 00:03:25.600
If I had, I would have intervened.

00:03:25.600 --> 00:03:31.290
In our culture, women are the most precious
thing we have.

00:03:31.290 --> 00:03:34.690
Beating a woman is completely unacceptable.

00:03:34.690 --> 00:03:37.180
Handan and Sedat have arrived at court.

00:03:37.180 --> 00:03:39.320
Her lawyer is already waiting.

00:03:39.320 --> 00:03:45.900
Gül Erdoğmuş has represented many women
who have fallen victim to violence.

00:03:45.900 --> 00:03:50.420
The Turkish government stresses it’s taking
the matter very seriously – and recently

00:03:50.420 --> 00:03:52.360
published THIS video:

00:03:52.360 --> 00:04:05.640
The message: Zero tolerance for domestic violence.

00:04:05.640 --> 00:04:09.640
The government needs to do more to protect
women than release videos like this.

00:04:09.640 --> 00:04:14.050
Our society dictates so much to women: How
they should dress; that being a housewife

00:04:14.050 --> 00:04:16.940
and mother is the best career for them...

00:04:16.940 --> 00:04:22.509
These are the messages our politicians are
constantly sending.

00:04:22.509 --> 00:04:28.370
It’s time for Handan to enter the courtroom.

00:04:28.370 --> 00:04:31.349
The trial against her husband continues.

00:04:31.349 --> 00:04:33.509
TV cameras are not allowed inside.

00:04:33.509 --> 00:04:37.699
A courtroom artist captures the moment.

00:04:37.699 --> 00:04:40.630
Her husband is just a few meters away.

00:04:40.630 --> 00:04:43.080
She tries not to look him in the eyes.

00:04:43.080 --> 00:04:48.120
The judge is admitting a new psychiatric report
as evidence, confirming the defendant’s

00:04:48.120 --> 00:04:49.750
criminal liability.

00:04:49.750 --> 00:04:53.569
Then, the trial is adjourned.

00:04:53.569 --> 00:04:55.629
Again.

00:04:55.629 --> 00:04:59.660
Outside, a few supporters are waiting.

00:04:59.660 --> 00:05:02.759
The activists regularly visit trials like
these.

00:05:02.759 --> 00:05:05.030
Their signs say: “You are not alone.”

00:05:05.030 --> 00:05:16.300
For a long time, I was afraid.

00:05:16.300 --> 00:05:17.770
But not anymore.

00:05:17.770 --> 00:05:19.499
My health has been ruined.

00:05:19.499 --> 00:05:24.150
I probably won’t ever be able to live in
happiness and peace again.

00:05:24.150 --> 00:05:30.189
That’s why I say to the women here in Turkey:
Don’t be afraid.

00:05:30.189 --> 00:05:31.240
Of anything!

00:05:31.240 --> 00:05:34.870
You are strong!

00:05:34.870 --> 00:05:37.310
In a few weeks, Handan will return.

00:05:37.310 --> 00:05:40.639
When the trial against her husband continues.

00:05:40.639 --> 00:05:42.879
The man who nearly killed her.

